# 5. Raw ADC conversion

For the ±10 V input range:

```cpp
float voltage =
    static_cast<float>(raw) * 10.0f / 32768.0f;
```

| Signed raw value | Approximate voltage |
|---:|---:|
| `-32768` | −10 V |
| `0` | 0 V |
| `32767` | Nearly +10 V |

