# 6. Recommended initial setup

```text
Interface:       16-bit parallel mode
Input range:     ±10 V
Oversampling:    Off
VIO:             3.3 V
Module supply:   External regulated 5 V
CONVST:          Shared across all four modules
Data bus:        One shared 16-bit bus
CS:              Separate for each module
BUSY:            Separate for each module
FRST:            Unconnected
```

The listed GIGA GPIO numbers are an example allocation. Confirm that they do not conflict with the selected I²C buses, USB configuration, safety inputs, or other peripherals before final wiring.

