| `SCK` (RD/SCLK) | `D13` |
| `DOUTA` (DB7) | `D12` |
| Tied `CVA + CVB` | `D39` |
| `RST` | `D40` |
| `CS` | `D41` |
| `BUSY` | `D45` |
| `VIO` + `RANGE` | `3.3V` |
| `OS0` + `OS1` + `OS2` | `GND` |
| `PAR/SER/BYTE SEL` | move resistors |
| `DB15/BYTE SEL` | `GND` |
| `+5V` | External regulated 5 V |
| `GND` | GIGA `GND` / common |
